flowchart LR
    Tenant["Tenant\ne.g. supermarket chain HQ"]

    subgraph Plans["Subscription plans"]
        Free["Free\n1 site, 2 cameras\n7-day retention"]
        Starter["Starter\nup to 3 sites\n30-day retention"]
        Pro["Pro\nup to 15 sites\nAI chatbot included\n90-day retention"]
        Enterprise["Enterprise\nunlimited sites\ncustom retention\nSSO / SLA"]
    end

    subgraph Entitlements["Metered entitlements"]
        E1["Max sites"]
        E2["Max cameras"]
        E3["Snapshot retention days"]
        E4["AI processing minutes"]
        E5["Chatbot messages / month"]
    end

    subgraph Metering["Usage metering"]
        Events["ParkingEvent stream"]
        UsageRecord["UsageRecord\nper tenant per metric per period"]
    end

    Billing["Stripe subscriptions\nSubscription + Plan"]
    Revenue["ParkVision recurring revenue"]

    Tenant -->|selects| Plans
    Free --> Entitlements
    Starter --> Entitlements
    Pro --> Entitlements
    Enterprise --> Entitlements

    Events --> UsageRecord
    UsageRecord -->|checked against| Entitlements
    Entitlements -->|enforced at| Tenant

    Tenant -->|pays via| Billing
    Billing --> Revenue
    UsageRecord -->|overage triggers upsell| Billing
